  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Hospitals pay for dependable people who follow safety steps exactly. They judge you by discipline, calm and accuracy of records.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is following a checklist exactly, every time.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and operation theatre anaesthesia and perfusion technology: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools help with scheduling and record summaries. Routine admin shrinks.
  </p>
  <p>
    Hands-on judgment, calm under pressure and accountability hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI for admin and study aids; later, own safety-critical work where qualified.
  </p>

